// Common Controls v6 for the plug-in DLL (MinGW builds; MSVC builds get it from the #pragma in PluginProcessor.cpp).
// JUCE imports TaskDialogIndirect, which only exists in Common Controls v6. A DLL needs resource ID 2
// (ISOLATIONAWARE_MANIFEST_RESOURCE_ID): without it, hosts whose process has no v6 manifest (Ableton Live's
// plug-in scanner, FL Studio's bridge) get error 127 from LoadLibrary and silently drop the plug-in.
2 24 "comctl6.manifest"
